WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.647
A raw file is flexible, but Spark may need to infer or be given the schema.

00:00:05.647 --> 00:00:10.257
A curated Delta table has a stronger table contract.

00:00:10.257 --> 00:00:18.562
For teaching, think of raw files as ingestion material and tables as reusable analytical assets.

00:00:18.562 --> 00:00:22.858
That is not an absolute rule, but it is a helpful workflow.
